perhaps the only shops who can afford to re-stock are the larger ones, 
possibly part of a chain of shops, like Safeways.

or if a shopkeeper has > $n then he can afford to send creatures out to 
collect stuff that's lying around and bring it back. he pays them like 
$1 for each thing no matter how valuable or worthless it is (want to 
ruin the economy? plant hundreds of rocks near a shop), but this would 
only work for general stores. any way, i'd like to see shops 
periodically re-stocked with new items.


